message: "If you use this specification, please cite it."
title: "PP-SPEC-065: Proof of Efficacy Mapping to the in-toto Attestation Framework and SLSA"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ellrod"
    given-names: "Craig"
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license-url: "https://github.com/proofprotocol/PP-SPEC-065-in-toto-slsa-mapping/blob/main/LICENSE.md"
repository-code: "https://github.com/proofprotocol/PP-SPEC-065-in-toto-slsa-mapping"
abstract: "A Proof Protocol mapping specification defining how proof records, ProofBundle, ProofStamp, and ProofRegister artifacts can be expressed as in-toto attestations (Statement, predicate, DSSE envelope) and how SLSA Provenance and Verification Summary Attestations relate to Proof Protocol verdicts, without changing what constitutes proof."
keywords:
